{"id":"8494517c-4657-4141-9bd6-d47d2e5be9ea","createdAt":"2026-10-26T13:19:21.329Z","batchId":"states_qwen3-8-flash-opencode-go_low","approach":"html","modelId":"qwen3.8-flash-opencode-go","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"states","prompt":"Two states for a file list: an empty state with an upload call to action, and an error state with a retry button.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<h1>Project Files</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">Review what has been uploaded to the <strong>Atlas&nbsp;· Q4 launch</strong> workspace. Two states of the file list are shown below — switch between them to preview the empty state and the load-error state.</p>\n\n<div class=\"card\">\n  <div class=\"row between gap-lg\">\n    <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"state\" value=\"empty\" checked> Empty state</label>\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"state\" value=\"error\"> Error state</label>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n      <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Storage 2.4&nbsp;GB / 10&nbsp;GB</span>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Workspace: Atlas · Q4 launch</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"card\">\n  <div class=\"row between\">\n    <div>\n      <h2 class=\"card-title\" style=\"margin-bottom:0\">Files</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin:4px 0 0\">List view · sorted by last updated</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n      <button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Refresh list</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Settings</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n\n  <!-- EMPTY STATE -->\n  <div id=\"state-empty\">\n    <div class=\"center gap-lg\" style=\"padding:48px 24px\">\n      <svg width=\"72\" height=\"72\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <path d=\"M4 20h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-7l-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v13z\"/>\n        <path d=\"M12 12v6\"/><path d=\"m9 15 3-3 3 3\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <div class=\"center\" style=\"flex-direction:column\">\n        <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 6px\">No files yet</h3>\n        <p class=\"muted\" style=\"max-width:46ch;margin:0\">Upload your first document, image or export to start building this workspace. Supported formats: PDF, DOCX, XLSX, CSV, PNG, JPG, MP4 — up to 250&nbsp;MB per file.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-lg\" type=\"button\">⬆ Upload files</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-lg\" type=\"button\">New folder</button>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin:0\">Or <button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" type=\"button\" style=\"padding:0 4px\">import from a link</button> · <button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" type=\"button\" style=\"padding:0 4px\">connect Google Drive</button></p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ERROR STATE -->\n  <div id=\"state-error\" hidden>\n    <div class=\"alert alert-destructive\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1\">\n        <strong>We couldn’t load your files</strong>\n        <p class=\"small\" style=\"margin:6px 0 0\">The request to the file service timed out after 30&nbsp;s. Your uploaded files are safe — this is a connectivity issue, not a data loss.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"center gap-lg\" style=\"padding:32px 24px\">\n      <svg width=\"56\" height=\"56\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"down\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <path d=\"M12 9v4\"/><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"/>\n        <path d=\"M10.3 3.9 1.7 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.7 3h17.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-3L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0z\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <div class=\"center\" style=\"flex-direction:column\">\n        <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 6px\">List request failed</h3>\n        <p class=\"muted\" style=\"max-width:46ch;margin:0\">Automatic retries didn’t succeed. Check your connection and try again, or contact your workspace admin if the problem persists.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-lg\" type=\"button\">↻ Retry now</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-lg\" type=\"button\">Contact support</button>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin:0\">Last attempt <strong>14:32:08</strong> · 3 of 3 retries used · Error&nbsp;<code>FILES_LIST_TIMEOUT</code> (504)</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n    <table>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td class=\"num\" style=\"width:auto\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">GET</span></td><td><code>/api/workspaces/atlas-q4/files</code></td><td class=\"down num\">504 Gateway Timeout</td><td class=\"muted small\">30.0&nbsp;s</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"num\" style=\"width:auto\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">GET</span></td><td><code>/api/workspaces/atlas-q4/quota</code></td><td class=\"down num\">— aborted</td><td class=\"muted small\">—</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n    <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin:12px 0 0\"><button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" type=\"button\" style=\"padding:0 4px\">Copy diagnostic report</button> to help us investigate faster.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"muted small\">Tip: the “Refresh list” button in the panel header also re-runs the request in either state.</p>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var radios = document.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"state\"]');\n  var empty = document.getElementById('state-empty');\n  var error = document.getElementById('state-error');\n  radios.forEach(function (r) {\n    r.addEventListener('change', function () {\n      var isError = document.querySelector('input[name=\"state\"]:checked').value === 'error';\n      empty.hidden = isError;\n      error.hidden = !isError;\n    });\n  });\n})();\n</script>","deltas":[[13981,"<h1>Project"],[14106," Files</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">"],[14356,"Review what has been uploaded to the"],[14480," <strong>Atlas&nbsp;· Q"],[14738,"4 launch</strong> workspace. Two states of the file list are shown below"],[14869," — switch between them"],[14987," to preview the empty state and the load"],[15143,"-error state.</p>\n\n<div class=\"card\">\n  "],[15360,"<div class=\"row between gap-lg\">\n   "],[15482," <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n     "],[15598," <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\""],[15714,"state\" value=\"empty\" checked>"],[15825," Empty state</label>\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type"],[15969,"=\"radio\" name=\"state\" value=\"error\"> Error"],[16083," state</label>\n    </div>\n    "],[16243,"<div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n      <span class=\""],[16427,"badge badge-outline\">Storage"],[16592," 2.4&nbsp;GB / 10&nbsp;GB</span>\n      <span class=\"badge badge"],[16744,"-secondary\">Workspace: Atlas · Q4 launch</span>\n    </div>\n  </div"],[16905,">\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"card\">\n  "],[17071,"<div class=\"row between\">\n    <div>\n      <h2 class=\""],[17232,"card-title\" style=\"margin-bottom:0\">Files</h2>"],[17350,"\n      <p class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin:4px 0"],[17504," 0\">List"],[17628," view · sorted by last updated</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class"],[17780,"=\"row gap-sm\">\n      <button class=\""],[17914,"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Refresh list</button>\n"],[18064,"      <button class=\"btn btn-seconda